        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through partnerships with industry influencers and elite athletes, and in collaboration with the various communities we serve, we develop next-generation products that define winning moments in sports.",
        "start_character": 2732,
        "end_character": 2933
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001988894-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001988894-26-000004-b27b2373668ae7d5",
        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also are subject to extensive and evolving regulations regarding the manufacturing, processing, distribution, importing, exporting and labeling of our products and their raw materials.",
        "start_character": 80647,
        "end_character": 80834
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001988894-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001988894-26-000004-b27b2373668ae7d5",
        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the combination of our owned and sourced manufacturing across different geographic regions provides a well-balanced, flexible approach to product procurement.",
        "start_character": 53428,
        "end_character": 53597
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001988894-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001988894-26-000004-b27b2373668ae7d5",
        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We empower these brands to autonomously connect with consumers and develop products to drive growth.",
        "start_character": 9620,
        "end_character": 9720
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001988894-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001988894-26-000004-b27b2373668ae7d5",
        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Beyond net zero, we are working toward other key goals, such as, but not limited to, sourcing 100% renewable electricity by the end of 2027, ensuring 70% of waste in own operations and Tier 1 is recycled or reused by 2030, and advancing workforce diversity with targets of 50% women in the workforce and at least 45% in people manager roles by 2030.",
        "start_character": 50946,
        "end_character": 51295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001988894-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001988894-26-000004-b27b2373668ae7d5",
        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we must comply with an increasing number of laws designed to combat abuses of human rights in supply chain operations, such as the UFLPA.",
        "start_character": 105237,
        "end_character": 105387
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001988894-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001988894-26-000004-b27b2373668ae7d5",
        "accession_number": "0001988894-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Importantly, we have focused on the succession and development of our most senior roles by forming, with our Executive Committee, a talent council focused on developing a pipeline of talent for the most critical senior positions.",
